{
  "_comment": [
    "One entry per page under comparison. `roles` maps THIS page's markup onto the",
    "shared role vocabulary the diff speaks: a paragraph is `prose_p` on every",
    "target, whatever it is called in that page's own stylesheet. First selector",
    "that matches something laid out wins, so the list is a fallback chain.",
    "LessWrong's class names here were read off the LIVE PAGE with capture.py",
    "--discover; no LessWrong source was consulted (see README.md)."
  ],
  "lw": {
    "url": "https://www.lesswrong.com/posts/vJFdjigzmcXMhNTsx/simulators",
